    fsync_after_write    med=    <T> (min    <NUM> max    <NUM>)  <- durability tax: <T> to make <SZ> crash-safe (<SZ>/s effective)
    read_cached          med=    <T> (min    <NUM> max    <NUM>)  =   <SZ>/s
    mmap_plus_sha256     med=    <T> (min    <NUM> max    <NUM>)  =   <SZ>/s
    unlink               med=     <T> (min     <NUM> max    <NUM>)
    O_DIRECT write       med=    <T>  =   <SZ>/s
    O_DIRECT read               <SZ>/s (<SZ> in <T>) - page cache bypassed

  ### tmpfs /tmp  (/tmp)  fs= fstype=tmpfs
