    unlink               med=     <T> (min     <NUM> max     <NUM>)
    O_DIRECT             not supported on this fs (Invalid argument) - expected on tmpfs
    O_DIRECT read        unavailable on this fs

  many small files (shard-heavy pipelines):
    ext4       write 2000x1KiB:  <T> ( <BIGNUM> files/s) | read-back  <T> | write+fsync 100:  <T> (  <T>/op)
    tmpfs /tmp write 2000x1KiB:  <T> (<BIGNUM> files/s) | read-back  <T> | write+fsync 100:  <T> (  <T>/op)

  note: reads above are page-cache warm unless O_DIRECT; that gap IS the finding for caching design.
$ dd if=/dev/zero of=./probe_dd.bin bs=1M count=200 conv=fsync 2>&1 | tail -1; rm -f probe_dd.bin
